Cubo semantico de BabyDuck
Formato: izquierdo operador derecho -> resultado

Aritmeticos
  int    +  int    -> int
  int    +  float  -> float
  float  +  int    -> float
  float  +  float  -> float
  int    -  int    -> int
  int    -  float  -> float
  float  -  int    -> float
  float  -  float  -> float
  int    *  int    -> int
  int    *  float  -> float
  float  *  int    -> float
  float  *  float  -> float
  int    /  int    -> int
  int    /  float  -> float
  float  /  int    -> float
  float  /  float  -> float

Relacionales (el int resultante vale 1 si es verdadero y 0 si es falso)
  int    >  int    -> int
  int    >  float  -> int
  float  >  int    -> int
  float  >  float  -> int
  int    <  int    -> int
  int    <  float  -> int
  float  <  int    -> int
  float  <  float  -> int
  int    != int    -> int
  int    != float  -> int
  float  != int    -> int
  float  != float  -> int

Asignacion (variable = expresion)
  int    =  int    -> int
  int    =  float  -> error
  float  =  int    -> float
  float  =  float  -> float

Signo delante de un valor
  +int    -> int
  +float  -> float
  -int    -> int
  -float  -> float

Cualquier operacion con un operando void o error da error.
